<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Thank you</title>
<style>
  body{margin:0;background:#f4f5f2;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
       display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:100vh;padding:20px;color:#0b0b0b}
  .box{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:34px 28px;max-width:420px;text-align:center;
       box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.07)}
  .tick{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#e8f6e8;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 16px}
  h1{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.3px}
  p{font-size:14.5px;color:#52514e;margin:0 0 6px;line-height:1.5}
  a{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;color:#2a78d6;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
  .ph{margin-top:14px;padding:11px 13px;border-radius:9px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left}
  .ph.ok{background:#eef8ee;border:1px solid #c6e6c6;color:#1c6b1c}
  .ph.no{background:#fdf4e7;border:1px solid #f0d8ae;color:#8a5a12}
</style></head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="tick"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0ca30c" stroke-width="3"
      stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div>
    <h1>Thank you</h1>
    <p>Your feedback for <b><%= rr.name %></b> has been recorded.</p>
    <p>Ratings from the crew decide this running room's monthly grading, so it genuinely counts.</p>
    <%# A photograph that did not make it is SAID SO, on the page, at the moment
        it happened. A man who took a picture of a broken fitting and was shown
        an unqualified "thank you" would walk away believing the officer had it. %>
    <% if (photo) { %><div class="ph <%= photo.ok ? 'ok' : 'no' %>"><%= photo.text %></div><% } %>
    <a href="<%= url('/f/' + rr.code) %>">Submit another</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
